    "label": {},
    "short_label": {
      "en": "$bunct_Rate1"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "Weekly personal rate of Jobseeker's Benefit (bunct_ie) paid to claimants whose previous weekly earnings (PWE) fall in the lowest band, below the $bunct_Thres1 cut-off (€150/week). It is set as the 'band_amount' parameter of the SchedCalc function in bunct_ie that computes the graduated personal rate, and stood at €109.50/week from 2025 (the lowest of four PWE-graduated rates described in the country report and the benefits theme doc, e.g. 'PWE < €150: €109.50')."
    },
    "explanation": {
      "en": "EUROMOD function group: Reduced rates and thresholds"
    },
